1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,410
USR is the Repository Systems Unit.

2
00:00:03,510 --> 00:00:06,976
It manages the education repository and the

3
00:00:07,026 --> 00:00:10,820
integrated library management system, or EKCMS.

4
00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:16,980
Its work also covers library ICT equipment, networks, and security systems.

5
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:21,239
The unit page brings together its functions, monitoring dashboard,

6
00:00:21,289 --> 00:00:25,640
annual work targets, programmes, activities, and contact information.

7
00:00:35,120 --> 00:00:39,261
The USR Operations Monitoring Dashboard shows record totals,

8
00:00:39,311 --> 00:00:44,010
issues that need follow-up, and monitoring activity over six months.

9
00:00:44,110 --> 00:00:50,130
In the Apa yang berlaku section, select Dalam tindakan to focus on open items.

10
00:00:50,230 --> 00:00:52,604
You can also filter by category, such as EKCMS.

11
00:00:52,704 --> 00:00:56,056
Authorised officers can use the full dashboard to

12
00:00:56,106 --> 00:00:59,250
update records and upload supporting evidence.

13
00:01:13,100 --> 00:01:15,627
Under USR, open Pelaporan Mingguan SDP.

14
00:01:15,727 --> 00:01:21,190
Staff can choose the officer, month, and week to enter a report.

15
00:01:21,290 --> 00:01:24,111
Submission summaries show which reports are in

16
00:01:24,161 --> 00:01:27,170
and which are still due, making follow-up easier.

17
00:01:27,270 --> 00:01:30,755
To review earlier work, select a week in the reading panel

18
00:01:30,805 --> 00:01:34,350
or search for a keyword, such as bengkel, meaning workshop.

19
00:01:48,120 --> 00:01:54,600
The annual work targets section shows achievements for 2026 and targets for 2027.

20
00:01:54,700 --> 00:01:59,240
Open SKT 2026 for details on targets and progress by unit.

21
00:02:08,190 --> 00:02:12,350
Quick quiz. Where do you check for outstanding weekly reports? A.

22
00:02:12,400 --> 00:02:16,690
Operations Monitoring, B. Annual Work Targets, C. Weekly Reporting.

23
00:02:26,020 --> 00:02:30,000
The answer is C, Weekly Reporting.

